# Nmap Live Host Discovery - TryHackMe
Completed: 9 tasks - 120 points

## WHAT I LEARNED

| Scan Type | Command |
| :--- | :--- |
| ARP Scan             | `sudo nmap -PR -sn <ip target>` |

| ICMP Echo Scan          | `sudo nmap -PE -sn <ip target>` |

| ICMP Timestamp Scan     | `sudo nmap -PP -sn <ip target>` |

| ICMP Address Mask Scan     | `sudo nmap -PM -sn <ip target>` |

| TCP SYN Ping Scan         | `sudo nmap -PS -sn <ip target>` |

| TCP ACK Ping Scan          | `sudo nmap -PA -sn <ip target>` |
| UDP Ping Scan             | `sudo nmap -PU -sn <ip target>` |

## OPTIONS
- `-n`      -> no dns lookup
- `-R`      -> reverse DNS lookup for all hosts
- `-sn`     -> host discovery only (no port scan)
